                                                "sense_id": "6e79f085-50a6-30b2-a279-dc944a765975",
                                                "text": "Ayesha wheeled round, and, pointing to the girl Ustane, said one word, and one only, but it was quite enough, for the tone in which it was said meant volumes."
                                            }
